          "id": "a1",
          "text": "One agent can plan while a second model builds and a third reviews. That is a team."
        },
        {
          "id": "a2",
          "text": "In Create Session, switch Team on."
        },
        {
          "id": "a3",
          "text": "Pick a builder, which writes, a reviewer, which can only read, and how many review rounds it gets."
